<title>UK: Shin-Etsu Handotai America sets $50 mln 5-yr bond.</title>
<headline>Shin-Etsu Handotai America sets $50 mln 5-yr bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager DKB International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SHIN-ETSU HANDATAI AMERICA. INC</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 COUPON     6.875     MATURITY    17.JUL.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.79     PAY DATE    17.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  23 BP     LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  =	   DENOMS (M) ONE	 SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC   13 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	DIRECT, UNSECURED, UNCONDITIONAL AND UNSUBORDINATED.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
